<title>USA: IPO PRICING - V-ONE Corp 3.0 mln at $5/shr.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - V-ONE Corp 3.0 mln at $5/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			   V-ONE Corp</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $5</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range			$5</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			3 million</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter		  Piper Jaffray</p>
<p>NOTE: The underwriter said that shares were reduced to three million from 3.3 million, and the price range was reduced to $5 a share from $6 to $8 a share.</p>
